            "line": 1191,
            "text": "theorem actualP1_eq (T κ : ℝ) {J : Set ℝ} (hJ : IsOpen J) {L : Field}\n    (hL : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ L (logDomain J hJ).carrier) (y : ℝ) {η : ℝ} (hη : η ∈ J) :\n    actualP1 T κ L (y, η) = damping T κ y * referenceP1 L (y, η)"
